-- Subsection (10): the defence. It is limited to the paragraphs that are contraventions of subsection (5), (8)(a) and (9)(a), and is a defence "if the person proves"
-- one of two things. When neither is proved the answer is JUST FALSE, worded "this section gives no defence on these facts" (NOTHINGBURGER, (b)).
