    `the day the corporation announced or disseminated the information` IS A DATE @desc On what date did the corporation announce or disseminate the information stated in the notice to the organised market operated by the approved exchange?
    `the public holidays` IS A LIST OF DATE @desc On which dates in the period were there public holidays in Singapore? (Saturdays and Sundays are counted automatically.)
